@startuml ChainOfResponsibility_ValidationPipeline
' If any modifications are done to the classes participating in this pattern,
' this diagram must be updated accordingly.

title Chain of Responsibility — Audio Validation Pipeline

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FEFECE
  BorderColor #A80036
}

note as N1
  <b>CHAIN OF RESPONSIBILITY (Behavioral)</b>
  Each handler validates one aspect of the audio file.
  On failure: returns ValidationResult.Reject() immediately.
  On success: delegates to the next handler via base.HandleAsync().
  Chain order: Extension → MIME → Spectral.
  The Facade wires the chain and injects a typed ILogger into
  each handler; callers only see AudioPipelineFacade.ValidateAsync().
end note

interface IAudioValidationHandler << Handler >> {
  + SetNext(next) : IAudioValidationHandler
  + HandleAsync(context, ct) : Task<ValidationResult>
}

abstract class AudioValidationHandler << AbstractHandler >> {
  - _next : IAudioValidationHandler?
  + SetNext(next) : IAudioValidationHandler
  + HandleAsync(context, ct) : Task<ValidationResult>
}

class ExtensionValidationHandler << ConcreteHandler1 >> {
  - registry : AudioFormatRegistry
  - logger   : ILogger<ExtensionValidationHandler>
  + HandleAsync(context, ct) : Task<ValidationResult>
}

note right of ExtensionValidationHandler
  Rejects empty extension.
  Rejects unknown extension.
  Rejects known lossy format.
  Logs DEBUG on pass, INFO on reject.
end note

class MimeValidationHandler << ConcreteHandler2 >> {
  - registry : AudioFormatRegistry
  - logger   : ILogger<MimeValidationHandler>
  + HandleAsync(context, ct) : Task<ValidationResult>
}

note right of MimeValidationHandler
  Pass-through if MimeType is null.
  Rejects unrecognised MIME type.
  Rejects known lossy MIME type.
  Logs DEBUG on pass, INFO on reject.
end note

class SpectralValidationHandler << ConcreteHandler3 >> {
  - analyzerFactory : IAudioAnalyzerFactory
  - logger          : ILogger<SpectralValidationHandler>
  + HandleAsync(context, ct) : Task<ValidationResult>
}

note right of SpectralValidationHandler
  Requires LocalFilePath to be set.
  Runs FFT energy-ratio analysis.
  Rejects likely transcodes.
  Logs INFO with cutoff Hz and ratio.
end note

IAudioValidationHandler    <|.. AudioValidationHandler
AudioValidationHandler     <|-- ExtensionValidationHandler
AudioValidationHandler     <|-- MimeValidationHandler
AudioValidationHandler     <|-- SpectralValidationHandler
ExtensionValidationHandler --> MimeValidationHandler     : _next
MimeValidationHandler      --> SpectralValidationHandler : _next

@enduml
